# Arrab Studio

Read `AGENTS.md` before large edits. Running product UI is `apps/desktop`. API owns secrets and persistence.

- Solo / family / org are plan audiences. Gate with `audienceFromPlanId` and `navForRole`.
- Contract lives in `packages/shared`. Desktop calls `arrabApi` only.
- New copy: add `en` and `ar` in `apps/desktop/src/shared/i18n/locales/{en,ar}/<domain>.ts`.
- Family UI: `apps/desktop/src/domains/family/`. Org UI: `domains/organization/`.
- New pages: `pnpm new:feature <kebab>` → `apps/desktop/src/features/modules/`. Do not hand-edit App.tsx or catalog for a new route.
- Thin PRs. No drive-by refactors. Do not commit `.env` or credentials.
